  "notes": "{退勤|たいきん} means leaving work for the day. As a suru-verb, it means \"to leave work\", \"to clock out\".\n\nCommon compounds:\n- {退勤|たいきん}{時間|じかん} (time of leaving work)\n- {退勤|たいきん}{後|ご} (after work)\n\nAntonym: {出勤|しゅっきん} (going to work)\n\nRelated expressions:\n- タイムカードを{押|お}す (punch the time card)\n- {打刻|だこく}する (to clock in/out)\n- {定時|ていじ}で{上|あ}がる (leave at the regular time)",
